    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέκ-βᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going aside from</i>: metaph., <i>deviation from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δικαίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1307a7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of the
				<i>deviations</i> of constitutional forms, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυραννίς</span> is a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π</span>. of monarchy, oligarchy of aristocracy, democracy of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πολιτεία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1160a31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1279a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1283a29
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>digression</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.59
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.15.13
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> Cit.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν π. ποιήσασθαι, ποιεῖσθαι τὰς
				π</span>., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.157S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ παρέκβασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.2.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				31.30.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.101
			</span></i>.</div>
